supermox-ui (10.26) supermox; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: SuperMox web UI assets.
  * Install the SuperMox dark theme (theme-supermox-dark.css) into the
    widget toolkit themes directory so pveproxy serves it at
    /pwt/themes/theme-supermox-dark.css.
